#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_prune.go
msgid "Remove overlay packages ::gentoo already ships identically"
msgstr "删除与 ::gentoo 已随附的软件包完全相同的 overlay 软件包"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_prune.go
msgid ""
"Plan the removal of overlay packages ::gentoo already ships, and with\n"
"--apply carry that plan out.\n"
"\n"
"Only CONTENT may authorise a removal. The verdict from 'bentoo overlay compare'\n"
"selects the candidates, and then every version the two trees share, plus the\n"
"whole files/ tree, must match byte for byte. The two disagree in practice:\n"
"measured on the live overlay, 8 of the 74 packages the verdict calls redundant\n"
"carry real local changes, so a removal driven by the verdict alone deletes work.\n"
"\n"
"Without --apply nothing is removed, modified or disabled: the plan is printed\n"
"and the run ends. The plan lists, per package, every file that would go and\n"
"every .autoupdate/packages.toml entry that would be disabled with it.\n"
"\n"
"A removed package's registry entries are DISABLED, not deleted: each gets\n"
"enabled = false and disabled_by = \"auto\", the same pair --check writes when an\n"
"ebuild vanishes, so the verified probe survives and is re-enabled on its own if\n"
"the package ever returns. --delete-registry deletes them instead, and\n"
"--keep-registry leaves the file untouched.\n"
"\n"
"Packages carrying an UNDECLARED difference — one the byte comparison found and\n"
"nobody wrote down — are printed under their own heading and left alone unless\n"
"--include-patched says otherwise.\n"
"\n"
"One kind of undeclared difference no flag reaches: the kind the overlay's own\n"
"content PROVES is ours, because our ebuild applies a patch ::gentoo does not\n"
"ship for that package. Such a package is refused outright and the refusal names\n"
"the file. ::gentoo never had it, so there would be nothing to restore it from.\n"
"\n"
"A package whose registry entry DECLARES 'patched' is refused outright, and no\n"
"flag here reaches it. The declaration already makes 'overlay compare' call it\n"
"'keep' rather than 'redundant', and this command never removes a package the\n"
"verdict refused. If such a copy is genuinely obsolete, clear its declaration\n"
"first — that is 'overlay analyze''s business, and it leaves a record of the\n"
"decision that a flag on this command would not.\n"
"\n"
"Packages no run may remove are printed last, each with its reason.\n"
"\n"
"A local ::gentoo tree is required, because an API provider has no content to\n"
"authorise anything with. Configure one in ~/.config/bentoo/config.yaml:\n"
"\n"
"  repositories:\n"
"    gentoo:\n"
"      provider: local\n"
"      path: /var/db/repos/gentoo\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  bentoo overlay prune                          # plan the whole overlay\n"
"  bentoo overlay prune app-editors              # plan one category\n"
"  bentoo overlay prune app-editors/zed          # plan one package\n"
"  bentoo overlay prune --include-patched        # consider the diverging ones too\n"
"  bentoo overlay prune --apply                  # carry the plan out\n"
"  bentoo overlay prune --apply --keep-registry  # remove the files, keep the registry as is\n"
"  bentoo overlay prune --apply --delete-registry  # remove the files and their registry entries"
msgstr ""
"规划移除 ::gentoo 已随附的overlay 软件包，并使用\n"
"--apply 执行该计划。\n"
"\n"
"只有 CONTENT 才能授权移除。“bentoo overlay compare”的判定结果\n"
"选择候选版本，然后两个树共有的每个版本，再加上\n"
"整个 files/ 树必须逐字节匹配。两者在实践中存在分歧：\n"
"在实时 overlay 上进行测量，在判定为冗余的 74 个软件包中，有 8 个\n"
"包含实际的本地更改，因此仅由“判定”驱动的移除操作会删除工作内容。\n"
"\n"
"如果不使用 --apply，则不会删除、修改或禁用任何内容：只会打印计划\n"
"然后运行结束。该计划按软件包列出了每个将被删除的文件，以及\n"
"以及将与之一起禁用的每个 .autoupdate/packages.toml 条目。\n"
"\n"
"被移除软件包的注册表条目会被“禁用”，而不是删除：每个条目都会写入\n"
"enabled = false 和 disabled_by = \"auto\"，与 ebuild 消失时 --check 写入的一对相同，\n"
"因此已验证的探测得以保留，软件包回来时会自动重新启用。--delete-registry 会删除它们，\n"
"--keep-registry 则不改动该文件。\n"
"\n"
"带有“UNDECLARED”差异的包（即字节比较发现的差异，且\n"
"没有人记录下来 — 会在各自的标题下打印出来，并且保持原样，除非\n"
"除非 --include-patched 指定了其他方式。\n"
"\n"
"有一种未声明的差异不受任何标志的影响：即 overlay 自身\n"
"内容证明属于我们，因为我们的 ebuild 应用了一个 ::gentoo 不会\n"
"为该软件包提供。此类软件包会被直接拒绝，且拒绝信息会指明\n"
"该文件。::gentoo 从来没有过它，因此也就没有可用于恢复它的来源。\n"
"\n"
"如果软件包的注册表项声明为“patched”，则该软件包会被直接拒绝，并且没有\n"
"这里的标志可以影响到它。该声明已使“overlay compare”将其称为\n"
"“keep”而不是“redundant”，并且此命令绝不会删除\n"
"判定为“拒绝”。如果此类副本确实已过时，请先清除其声明\n"
"首先 — 这属于“overlay analyze”的职责，它会留下\n"
"此命令上的标志不会做出的决定。\n"
"\n"
"no run 可能会移除的软件包将最后打印，每个软件包都附有原因。\n"
"\n"
"需要一个本地 ::gentoo 树，因为 API 提供方没有内容可以\n"
"用于授权任何内容。请在 ~/.config/bentoo/config.yaml 中配置一个：\n"
"\n"
"  repositories:\n"
"    gentoo:\n"
"      provider: local\n"
"      path: /var/db/repos/gentoo\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"  bentoo overlay prune                          # 规划整个 overlay\n"
"  bentoo overlay prune app-editors              # 规划一个类别\n"
"  bentoo overlay prune app-editors/zed          # 规划一个软件包\n"
"  bentoo overlay prune --include-patched        # 也考虑存在分歧的包\n"
"  bentoo overlay prune --apply                  # 执行计划\n"
"  bentoo overlay prune --apply --keep-registry  # 删除文件，注册表保持原样\n"
"  bentoo overlay prune --apply --delete-registry  # 删除文件及其注册表条目"

