#: cmd/bentoo/root.go
msgid "Enable verbose output: diagnostics at the debug level and above. Without --verbose or --quiet the level comes from the BENTOO_LOG_LEVEL environment variable, which accepts debug, info, warn or error in any letter case and defaults to info; --verbose and --quiet both outrank it, and --quiet outranks --verbose"
msgstr "启用详细输出：调试级别及以上级别的诊断信息。如果没有指定 --verbose 或 --quiet，则日志级别由环境变量 BENTOO_LOG_LEVEL 决定，该变量接受 debug、info、warn 或 error（不区分大小写），默认值为 info；--verbose 和 --quiet 的优先级都高于该环境变量，而 --quiet 的优先级又高于 --verbose。"

#: cmd/bentoo/root.go
msgid "Suppress non-error output"
msgstr "抑制非错误输出"

#: cmd/bentoo/root.go
msgid "Disable colored output"
msgstr "禁用彩色输出"

#: cmd/bentoo/root.go
msgid "Overlay to work on for this run, instead of overlay.path. Without it, a run started inside another checkout of the configured overlay (a worktree, a second clone) uses that checkout and says so"
msgstr "本次运行要处理的 overlay，而非 overlay.path。如果没有此选项，在已配置的 overlay（工作树、第二个克隆）的另一个签出中启动的运行将使用该签出，并会说明这一点。"

#: cmd/bentoo/root.go
msgid "Renderer for this run: auto, plain, inline or fullscreen. auto is the default and picks inline on a terminal and plain off one; it never picks fullscreen, because taking over somebody's screen is not something configuring nothing should do. plain contains no escape sequence at all and is what a pipe, a log file and a CI job want. This flag outranks the BENTOO_UI environment variable, which outranks the ui.mode configuration key. On the overlay autoupdate command alone, the deprecated opt-out flag documented there outranks all three; no other command has one. A value outside that set is rejected and NOTHING runs"
msgstr "此运行的渲染器：auto、plain、inline 或 fullscreen。auto 是默认值，在终端上选择 inline，在非终端上选择 plain；它绝不会选择 fullscreen，因为接管他人的屏幕不是“未配置任何内容”时应该做的事情。plain 完全不包含转义序列，是管道、日志文件和 CI 作业所需要的。此标志的优先级高于 BENTOO_UI 环境变量，而 BENTOO_UI 环境变量的优先级又高于 ui.mode 配置键。仅在 overlay autoupdate 命令中，其中记录的已弃用“选择退出”标志的优先级高于上述三者；其他命令均不具备此标志。该集合之外的值将被拒绝，且 NOTHING 将不会运行"

#: cmd/bentoo/root.go
msgid "List every package found up to date in the version-check section instead of reporting them as a count alone. It changes WHAT IS SHOWN and nothing else — the same packages are scanned, validated and acted upon either way. The count is the default because the up-to-date packages are the bulk of a 269-package overlay, and listing them is most of the reason a check that found four updates used to print 348 lines"
msgstr "在版本检查部分列出所有已发现的最新软件包，而不是仅报告其数量。它只改变 WHAT IS SHOWN，除此之外别无其他——无论哪种方式，都会对相同的软件包进行扫描、验证和处理。计数是默认值，因为最新软件包在包含 269 个软件包的 Overlay 中占了绝大部分，列出这些软件包是导致发现四个更新的检查过去会打印 348 行的主要原因。"

#: cmd/bentoo/root.go
msgid "Also write the report to this path. The format follows the extension: .md is Markdown, .json is JSON, anything else is plain text. The file always carries the COMPLETE report — every package, every reason in full, nothing shortened — whatever --all and --ui asked of the terminal, because a report is saved precisely for when the terminal is gone. A path that cannot be written is reported, and the run still renders to the terminal and still exits with the status it would have had"
msgstr "还将报告写入此路径。格式取决于扩展名：.md 表示 Markdown，.json 表示 JSON，其他任何扩展名均表示纯文本。该文件始终包含完整的报告——每个软件包、每个原因都完整无缺，没有任何缩略——无论 --all 和 --ui 对终端有何要求，因为报告正是为了在终端关闭后仍可查阅而保存。如果报告了无法写入的路径，运行仍会向终端输出，并仍会以本应具有的状态退出。"

#: cmd/bentoo/root.go
msgid "Manage the Bentoo overlay repository"
msgstr "管理 Bentoo Overlay 仓库"

#: cmd/bentoo/root.go
msgid "Commands for managing the Bentoo overlay repository including adding files, checking status, committing changes, and pushing to remote."
msgstr "用于管理 Bentoo Overlay 仓库的命令，包括添加文件、检查状态、提交更改以及推送到远程。"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot.go
msgid "Manage btrfs snapshots (btrbk + systemd)"
msgstr "管理 btrfs 快照（btrbk + systemd）"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot.go
msgid ""
"Manage btrfs snapshots declaratively via a single snapshot.toml.\n"
"\n"
"bentoolkit orchestrates mature tools — btrbk for snapshot/send-receive and systemd\n"
"for scheduling — rather than reimplementing them.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  bentoo snapshot apply               Render native config + install the timer\n"
"  bentoo snapshot run                 Run the snapshot pipeline now\n"
"  bentoo snapshot list                List local snapshots per subvolume\n"
"  bentoo snapshot status              Show last run, timer state, and free space"
msgstr ""
"通过单个 snapshot.toml 以声明式方式管理 btrfs 快照。\n"
"\n"
"bentoolkit 协调成熟的工具——btrbk 用于快照/发送-接收，以及 systemd\n"
"用于调度 — 而不是重新实现它们。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"  bentoo snapshot apply               渲染原生配置 + 安装定时器\n"
"  bentoo snapshot run                 立即运行快照管道\n"
"  bentoo snapshot list                列出每个子卷的本地快照\n"
"  bentoo snapshot status              显示上次运行、定时器状态和可用空间"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot.go
msgid "path to snapshot.toml (default: /etc/bentoo, then XDG)"
msgstr "snapshot.toml 的路径（默认：/etc/bentoo，然后是 XDG）"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot.go
msgid "dry-run: %s"
msgstr "试运行：%s"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_apply.go
msgid "Render native config and install the systemd timer"
msgstr "渲染原生配置文件并安装 systemd 定时器"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_apply.go
msgid ""
"Load and validate snapshot.toml, render the btrbk.conf, and install +\n"
"enable the systemd service/timer. Idempotent: re-running reconciles the units."
msgstr ""
"加载并验证 snapshot.toml，渲染 btrbk.conf，并安装 +\n"
"启用 systemd 服务/定时器。幂等性：再次运行将对单元进行协调。"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_apply.go
msgid "print the configs and systemd units that would be written, without writing them"
msgstr "打印将要写入的配置文件和systemd单元，但不实际写入它们"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_apply.go
msgid "snapshot configuration applied (%s)"
msgstr "已应用快照配置 (%s)"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_hook.go
msgid "Install or remove the opt-in Portage emerge snapshot hook (snapper only)"
msgstr "安装或移除选择加入的 Portage emerge 快照钩子（仅限 snapper）"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_hook.go
msgid ""
"Install or remove an OPT-IN Portage hook that snapshots before and after emerge.\n"
"\n"
"--install writes /etc/portage/bashrc.d/50-bentoo-snapshot.sh and wires it into\n"
"/etc/portage/bashrc via a managed block. The hook uses snapper's native pre/post\n"
"pair per emerged package (pre_pkg_setup / post_pkg_postinst), so it requires\n"
"engine.driver = \"snapper\". snapper errors never break an emerge.\n"
"\n"
"--uninstall cleanly removes the script and the managed block, preserving any\n"
"user content in /etc/portage/bashrc.\n"
"\n"
"The hook is never installed implicitly: 'bentoo snapshot apply' does not touch\n"
"/etc/portage — only this explicit command does."
msgstr ""
"安装或移除一个 OPT-IN Portage 钩子，该钩子会在 emerge 之前和之后创建快照。\n"
"\n"
"--install 会写入 /etc/portage/bashrc.d/50-bentoo-snapshot.sh 并将其关联到\n"
"通过托管块写入 /etc/portage/bashrc。该钩子使用 snapper 的原生 pre/post\n"
"每个已emerge的软件包一对（pre_pkg_setup / post_pkg_postinst），因此它需要\n"
"engine.driver = \"snapper\"。snapper 错误绝不会导致 emerge 中断。\n"
"\n"
"--uninstall 会彻底移除脚本和托管块，同时保留任何\n"
"/etc/portage/bashrc 中的用户内容。\n"
"\n"
"钩子绝不会被隐式安装：“bentoo snapshot apply”不会触及\n"
"/etc/portage — 只有这条显式命令才会这样做。"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_hook.go
msgid "install the Portage emerge hook (pre/post snapper snapshots)"
msgstr "安装 Portage emerge 钩子（pre/post snapper 快照）"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_hook.go
msgid "remove the Portage emerge hook"
msgstr "移除 Portage emerge 钩子"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_hook.go
msgid "Portage emerge hook removed"
msgstr "Portage emerge 钩子已移除"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_hook.go
msgid "Portage emerge hook installed — snapper pre/post snapshots around each emerged package"
msgstr "已安装 Portage emerge 钩子 — 在每个已 emerge 的软件包前后创建 snapper 快照"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_list.go
msgid "List local snapshots per subvolume"
msgstr "按子卷列出本地快照"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_list.go
msgid "also list remote snapshots (btrbk targets, restic repository)"
msgstr "也列出远程快照（btrbk 目标、restic 仓库）"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_list.go
msgid "(none)"
msgstr "（无）"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_list.go
msgid "remote %s unavailable: %v"
msgstr "远程 %s 不可用：%v"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_list.go
msgid "remote %s:"
msgstr "远程 %s："

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_prune.go
msgid "Apply the retention policy on demand"
msgstr "按需应用保留策略"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_prune.go
msgid ""
"Apply the [engine.retention] policy now, without taking a snapshot: the\n"
"engine-native prune for every subvolume (btrbk clean / snapper cleanup timeline)\n"
"plus the GFS retention sweep on every archive ship's rclone remote.\n"
"\n"
"--ship NAME scopes the prune to that one destination: the engine-local prune is\n"
"skipped and only the named ship's remote is pruned. Recorded incremental parents\n"
"are never deleted — each is the base of its subvolume's next incremental send."
msgstr ""
"立即应用 [engine.retention] 策略，不拍摄快照：\n"
"对每个子卷执行引擎原生清理（btrbk clean / snapper cleanup timeline）\n"
"外加对每个存档“ship”的 rclone 远程执行 GFS 保留清理。\n"
"\n"
"--ship NAME 将清理范围限定于该一个目标：引擎本地清理将被\n"
"被跳过，仅对指定船的远程进行清理。已记录的增量父级\n"
"永远不会被删除 — 每个都是其子卷下一次增量发送的基准。"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_prune.go
msgid "print the prune actions that would run, without executing them"
msgstr "打印将要运行的清理操作，但不执行它们"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_prune.go
msgid "scope the prune to the named [[ship]] destination"
msgstr "将清理范围限定为指定的 [[ship]] 目标"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_prune.go
msgid "snapshot prune completed (%d stages)"
msgstr "快照清理已完成（%d 个阶段）"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid "Restore a snapshot from a ship target into a path"
msgstr "将快照从“ship”目标还原到路径"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid ""
"Restore snapshot <id> into --target using the named --ship entry.\n"
"\n"
"The ship's type selects the path: an \"archive\" ship replays the object chain\n"
"(rclone cat | decompress | btrfs receive); a \"restic\" ship runs restic restore.\n"
"Restore is DESTRUCTIVE — it writes a subvolume into the target — so it prompts for\n"
"confirmation unless --yes is given.\n"
"\n"
"Each subvolume's objects live under their own remote prefix, so a restore has to\n"
"know which subvolume it reads from. With exactly one subvolume configured that is\n"
"implied and --subvolume is unnecessary; with several, name one — the restore\n"
"refuses to guess rather than read another subvolume's backups."
msgstr ""
"使用指定的 --ship 条目将快照 <id> 恢复到 --target。\n"
"\n"
"ship 的类型决定了路径：“archive”类型的 ship 会重放对象链\n"
"(rclone cat | decompress | btrfs receive)；“restic”类型的 ship 运行 restic restore。\n"
"还原操作具有破坏性 — 它会将一个子卷写入目标 — 因此系统会提示您\n"
"除非指定了 --yes，否则会要求确认。\n"
"\n"
"每个子卷的对象都位于各自的远程前缀下，因此还原操作必须\n"
"知道它从哪个子卷读取。如果只配置了一个子卷，那么\n"
"隐含，因此无需使用 --subvolume；如果有多个子卷，请指定一个 — 还原操作\n"
"拒绝猜测，而不是读取另一个子卷的备份。"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid "path to restore the snapshot into (required)"
msgstr "要将快照恢复到的路径（必填）"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid "name of the [[ship]] entry that drives the restore (required)"
msgstr "驱动还原的 [[ship]] 条目的名称（必填）"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid "which configured subvolume to restore from (needed only when several are configured)"
msgstr "要从中恢复的已配置子卷（仅在配置了多个子卷时需要）"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid "skip the destructive-restore confirmation prompt"
msgstr "跳过“破坏性还原”确认提示"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid "print the destructive restore actions without performing them"
msgstr "打印破坏性还原操作，但不执行这些操作"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid "dry-run: would restore snapshot %s into %s via ship %q (%s)"
msgstr "dry-run: 将通过 ship %[3]q (%[4]s) 将快照 %[1]s 还原到 %[2]s"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid "snapshot restored (%s → %s)"
msgstr "快照已还原（%s → %s）"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid "restore declined"
msgstr "还原被拒绝"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_rollback.go
msgid "Roll the system back to a snapshot (snapper only)"
msgstr "将系统回滚到快照（仅限 snapper）"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_rollback.go
msgid ""
"Roll the system back to snapshot <id> via snapper rollback.\n"
"\n"
"Rollback is snapper-specific: it requires engine.driver = \"snapper\" and is refused\n"
"for any other engine. It is DESTRUCTIVE — snapper makes a read-write copy of\n"
"snapshot <id> the new default subvolume, so the system boots into it on the next\n"
"reboot — and prompts for confirmation unless --yes is given."
msgstr ""
"通过 snapper rollback 将系统回滚到快照 <id>。\n"
"\n"
"回滚是 snapper 特有的：它需要 engine.driver = \"snapper\"，并且会被拒绝\n"
"对于任何其他引擎。这是破坏性的 — snapper 会创建\n"
"将快照 <id> 设为新的默认子卷，因此系统在下次重启时将引导至该子卷\n"
"reboot — 除非指定 --yes，否则会提示确认。"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_rollback.go
msgid "skip the destructive-rollback confirmation prompt"
msgstr "跳过“DESTRUCTIVE ROLLBACK”确认提示"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_rollback.go
msgid "print the destructive rollback action without performing it"
msgstr "打印破坏性回滚操作，但不执行该操作"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_rollback.go
msgid "dry-run: would run snapper rollback to snapshot %s — the system boots from it on next reboot"
msgstr "dry-run：将运行 snapper 回滚到快照 %s — 系统将在下次重启时从此快照启动"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_rollback.go
msgid "rollback to snapshot %s started — reboot to complete"
msgstr "已开始回滚到快照 %s — 请重启以完成操作"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_rollback.go
msgid "rollback declined"
msgstr "回滚被拒绝"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_run.go
msgid "Run the snapshot pipeline now"
msgstr "立即运行快照管道"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_run.go
msgid ""
"Execute the engine → prune → ship pipeline for every configured subvolume,\n"
"persist a RunResult for 'status', and exit non-zero if any stage failed. This is\n"
"the command driven by the systemd timer."
msgstr ""
"对每个已配置的子卷执行 engine → prune → ship 管道，\n"
"为“status”保留一个 RunResult，如果任何阶段失败，则以非零值退出。这是\n"
"由 systemd 定时器驱动的命令。"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_run.go
msgid "print the pipeline that would run, without executing it"
msgstr "打印将要运行的管道，但不执行它"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_status.go
msgid "Show the last run, timer state, and free space"
msgstr "显示上次运行、定时器状态和可用空间"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_status.go
msgid "last run: none recorded"
msgstr "上次运行：未记录"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_status.go
msgid "last run: ok at %s (%d stages)"
msgstr "上次运行：在 %s 成功（%d 个阶段）"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_status.go
msgid "last run: failed at %s (%d stages)"
msgstr "上次运行：在 %s 处失败（%d 个阶段）"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_status.go
msgid "timer: %s"
msgstr "计时器：%s"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_status.go
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "未知"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_status.go
msgid "next run: %s"
msgstr "下次运行：%s"

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_status.go
msgid "free space on %s: %s"
msgstr "%s 上的可用空间：%s"

#: cmd/bentoo/version.go
msgid "Print version information"
msgstr "打印版本信息"

#: cmd/bentoo/version.go
msgid "Print the version, commit hash, and build date of bentoo."
msgstr "打印 bentoo 的版本、提交哈希和构建日期。"

